// C1 regression: a multi-branch choice in which EVERY branch terminates with
// a cycle jump ("-->" / "--^") previously crashed the compiler with an
// empty-phi bounds panic (Index 0 out of range 0..<0) at the choice exit.
// The choice now correctly reports "no value" and codegen continues.

#use io

5 @ i =>
    i
    [0]
        -->
    [1]
        -->
    [3]
        -->
    |
        -->
io::out $ 200
